      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "data": {
        "title": "Invariants",
        "body": "Endpoint identities survive layout changes. Routing pins and lane geometry do not change semantic endpoints. Cross-graph ownership must be persisted with the owning graphs, not only in a workspace drawing.",
